From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:12:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sidebar): hide automated/test sessions by default +
 'Show automated & test sessions' toggle [daveey]

Per-profile sessions.automated_sources (list, "*" = whole store; default []) stamps
automated: bool on every sidebar row (recents/cron/messaging slices, /api/profiles/sessions,
/api/sessions, the project tree incl. the all-profiles tree), read under the store's own home.
The desktop drops those rows from recents, project lanes and messaging sections unless the
new filter-menu checkbox is on; pinned and blocked/needs-attention rows stay. One predicate
(store/sidebar-automated.ts) serves the list renderer and Cmd-]/Cmd-[ visible-order stepping.
